{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "I am standing here with patients waiting in the hallway and my billing ledger is a complete mess! I tried to post a check remittance from a major insurer for J.D. and somehow it applied half the money to an entirely different family's account, and when I clicked undo it split the rest across four closed invoice lines instead of letting me clear it out. I have no idea what buttons to click anymore and I need someone to call me right this second to help me fix these line items before I can see my next appointment.",
   "id": "gen-121",
   "subject": "URGENT HELP NEEDED: Payments applied to wrong accounts while patients waiting!"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am writing to inquire about the standard procedure for handling out-of-stock medication alerts and updating prescription orders with alternative therapeutic agents. Could you please provide guidance on the correct workflow for pharmacy substitution messaging?",
   "id": "gen-122",
   "subject": "Inquiry regarding medication out-of-stock alerts and substitution workflows"
  },
  {
   "body": "How do we restrict online booking in the portal so patients can only schedule certain visit types with specific providers? Need this changed ASAP.",
   "id": "gen-123",
   "subject": "Restrict online booking options"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi there, I was looking at our check-in screen this morning and I am a bit confused about how to change the columns in the waiting room view. I clicked around the settings gear near the top right, but I could not figure out where we customize the arrival and rooming status headers. Could you let me know how to update those display fields?",
   "id": "gen-124",
   "subject": "Confused about customizing waiting room columns"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hi, I am so sorry to bother you with this simple request, but could someone please help us deactivate a staff account for an employee who left our practice yesterday? Thank you so much for your assistance.",
   "id": "gen-125",
   "subject": "Deactivate staff user account"
  },
  {
   "body": "Need instructions to set up custom digital intake forms and fix validation errors when patients submit online.",
   "id": "gen-126",
   "subject": "Digital intake forms validation error"
  },
  {
   "body": "We need assistance with the out-of-stock medication alert workflow. Specifically, when a pharmacy notifies us that a drug is unavailable, we are unsure how to correctly route the substitution request through the system to an alternative therapeutic agent without creating duplicate active prescriptions in the patient chart. Please provide clear instructions on the steps required to process these changes efficiently during clinic hours.",
   "id": "gen-127",
   "subject": "Pharmacy substitution workflow for out of stock medications"
  },
  {
   "body": "Front desk needs to know how incoming lab results are routed to covering physicians when the primary provider is out. Please send instructions on updating these routing rules.",
   "id": "gen-128",
   "subject": "Routing lab results to covering physicians"
  },
  {
   "body": "Fix our online appointment booking right now! Patients are booking slots I am not working and I have a full waiting room.",
   "id": "gen-129",
   "subject": "Fix online booking now"
  },
  {
   "body": "We noticed a duplicate charge on our latest billing statement for our subscription tier. We were billed twice for the same monthly period. Please issue a credit to our account immediately to resolve this error.",
   "id": "gen-130",
   "subject": "Duplicate subscription charge on invoice"
  }
 ]
}
